putnami 0.0.0-golden — polyglot build orchestrator

Usage:
  putnami <command[,command...]> [options]

Build (from extensions):
  No extension is loaded. Name a language extension in
  putnami.workspace.json, then run: putnami extensions install

CI:
  impact-plan                  Emit the impacted plan of a change for a command list

Projects:
  projects list                List canonical workspace projects
  projects create              Create a project from template
  projects describe            Show project info
  projects sync                Sync projects from disk
  projects tag                 Manage project tags
  scopes list                  List workspace scopes (projects, groups, tags)

Workspace:
  init                         Initialize a new workspace
  install                      Install extensions and dependencies
  upgrade                      Upgrade CLI, extensions, and dependencies
  pin                          Pin the CLI version this workspace uses
  workspace describe           Describe the active workspace
  cli list|use                 Installed CLI binaries

Extensions & Templates:
  extensions install           Install extensions from config
  extensions list              List extensions
  extensions update            Update extensions
  extensions remove            Remove an extension
  extensions prepare           Prepare the provider runtimes of a source workspace
  extensions validate          Validate an extension manifest
  templates install            Install templates from config
  templates list               List installed templates
  templates update             Update templates
  templates remove             Remove a template
  templates validate           Validate a template manifest
  templates test               Test a template in a temporary workspace
  templates package            Package a template into an archive

Dependencies:
  deps install                 Install project dependencies
  cache clean                  Clear this repo's shared build cache
  cache gc                     Garbage-collect global caches to their budgets
  cache verify                 Verify cache determinism and restore equivalence

Configuration:
  config show                  Show effective configuration
  config set                   Set a configuration value
  context generate             Regenerate AI context
  context map                  Print the workspace orientation map
  context pack                 Print each project's agent-context document

Diagnostics:
  doctor                       Preflight production readiness under a deployment profile
  tree fingerprint             Print the digest identifying this worktree's exact state
  sessions list                List recent execution sessions
  sessions inspect             Inspect a specific session
  sessions replay              Resume delivery of a retained execution session
  sessions export              Export recorded sessions as JSONL
  sessions summary             Summarize recorded sessions, one row per run
  report                       Read back a run's report

Migration:
  migrate vnext                Migrate putnami.lock.json to the current format

Agents:
  mcp                          Run the MCP server over stdio for AI agent harnesses
  mcp install                  Register the MCP server in .mcp.json for Claude Code

Other:
  telemetry on|off|status|show Manage anonymous telemetry
  completion <shell>           Generate shell completions (bash, zsh, fish)

Common:
  -v, --verbose                Show job results and diagnostics
  -d, --debug                  Stream all events in real-time
  -h, --help                   Show help

Project Selection:
  --all                        All projects
  --impacted                   Projects affected by git changes
  --projects <list>            Comma-separated project names
  --tag <tags>                 Filter by tags
  --exclude-tag <tags>         Exclude by tags
  --baseline <branch>          Custom git baseline for --impacted; a job command with no target or --all implies --impacted

Execution:
  --credential-fd <n>          Read the run credential from descriptor <n>; keeps it out of every environment and file; custody level 2
  --no-cache                   Force re-execution (skip cache)
  --continue-on-error          Don't abort on first failure
  --dry-run                    Show changes without applying

Output:
  --output <format>            Output format: text | json | jsonl | cloud-logging
  --json                       Shorthand for --output=json
  --quiet                      Suppress non-error output
  --color                      Force color output
  --no-color                   Disable color output

Default Selection:
  no target            Feature branch: impacted vs trunk; main/master: local marker, then remote cache marker when active, otherwise all

Positional:
  .                    Current directory scope (project or subtree)

Help:
  putnami help <command>   Command help
  putnami help --man       Man page format
  putnami help --markdown  Markdown format

